  "fullDescription": "Watercolor illustrations Pink bloom, watercolor set, flowers pink and burgundy. Alphabet black, pink and gold for wedding monogram, initials and numbers. Floral illustrations hand painting.\n\nBright hand painted watercolor flowers, clipart for wedding invitation, greeting card, thank you card, party invitation, planner sticker, design blog, website, logo, banner, poster, birthday project, flyer, brochure, cover, presentation, print template, scrapbooking artwork, baby shower and so on.\n\nThis set includes 165 items:\n\n– 20 individual elements in PNG files with transparent background (different sizes about 2500 px x 3000 px / 8,3 in – 10 in);\n– 8 bouquets in PNG files with transparent background (different sizes about 4000 px x 4000 px / 13,3 in x 13,3 in);\n– 4 wreaths in PNG files with transparent background (size 5000 px x 5000 px / 16,7 in x 16,7 in);\n– 3 borders in PNG files with transparent background (size 5000 px x 3000 px / 16,7 in x 10 in);\n– 6 seamless (repeating) patterns in PNG files with transparent background and 6 seamless patterns in JPEG files with white / colored background (5000 px x 5000 px / 16,7 in x 16,7 in);\n– 5 frames borders for greeting cards in PNG files with transparent background (size letter 2400 px x 3300 px / 8 in x 11 in);\n– 2 backgrounds in JPEG files (size letter 2400 px x 3300 px / 8 in x 11 in);\n– 27 letters, 10 numbers black color in PNG files with transparent background (size 3000 px x 3000 px / 10 in x 10 in);\n– 27 letters, 10 numbers pink color in PNG files with transparent background (size 3000 px x 3000 px / 10 in x 10 in). Compatible with all major programs (Photoshop, Word, Canva, GIMP, etc.).\n– 27 letters, 10 numbers gold color in PNG files with transparent background (size 3000 px x 3000 px / 10 in x 10 in).\nCompatible with all major programs (Photoshop, Word, Canva, GIMP, etc.).",
